our luck a bit too far.

2044
01:39:56,865 --> 01:39:59,617
Oh, gosh, shit! God !

2045
01:40:01,787 --> 01:40:03,871
Right. Uh. . .

2046
01:40:03,956 --> 01:40:05,957
The possibility

2047
