2075
01:41:50,855 --> 01:41:54,107
Threatening the locals,
abusing the tourists,

2076
01:41:54,191 --> 01:41:56,151
terrifying the help.

2077
01:41:56,235 --> 01:41:58,069
The only chance now, l felt

2078
01:41:58,154 --> 01:42:01,156
was the possibility
that we'd gone to such excess

2079
01:42:01,615 --> 01:42:04,284
that nobody in the position
to bring the hammer
down on us

2080
01:42:04,368 --> 01:42:06,161
could possibly believe it.

2081
01:42:06,746 --> 01:42:09,497
Fifteen minutes to get
my attorney to the airport,

2082
01:42:10,124 --> 01:42:11,666
could we make it?

2083
01:42:12,418 --> 01:42:14,252
Christ!

2084
01:42:15,212 --> 01:42:16,755
No!

2085
01:42:17,673 --> 01:42:18,923
Oh, fuck!

2086
01:42:19,008 --> 01:42:20,967
Fuck.
Whoa, shit! Whoa, shit!

2087
01:42:21,052 --> 01:42:23,511
Oh, God. Oh, God.
You son of a bitch !

2088
01:42:23,596 --> 01:42:25,055
Oh, God.

2089
01:42:25,681 --> 01:42:26,931
