2092
01:42:30,478 --> 01:42:32,979
Go! Fuck!

2093
01:42:37,193 --> 01:42:39,652
Take a right here.
Take a right here.

2094
01:42:40,002 --> 01:42:46,002
[Cut: inaccurate cruelty piled on a dishonest Acosta. Excess, not honesty about a dangerous man.]

2095
01:42:48,996 --> 01:42:51,623
