01:50:42,678 --> 01:50:48,808
Viva Las Vegas

2193
01:50:50,727 --> 01:50:53,271
How l wish that
there were more

2194
01:50:53,355 --> 01:50:56,941
Than the 24 hours in the day

2195
01:50:57,025 --> 01:50:59,652
Even if l ran out of sleep

2196
01:50:59,736 --> 01:51:02,697
Boy, l wouldn't
sleep a minute away

2197
01:51:02,781 --> 01:51:06,284
Oh, there's blackjack
and poker
and the roulette wheel

2198
01:51:06,368 --> 01:51:09,662
A fortune won and lost
on every deal

2199
01:51:09,746 --> 01:51:12,540
All you need's a strong heart
and nerves of steel

2200
01:51:12,624 --> 01:51:16,168
So Viva Las Vegas

2201
01:51:16,253 --> 01:51:22,383
Viva Las Vegas

2202
01:51:22,467 --> 01:51:25,344
Viva Las Vegas
where the neon signs
are flashing

2203
01:51:25,429 --> 01:51:27,346
And the one-armed
bandits crashing

2204
01:51:27,431 --> 01:51:30,182
All those hopes
down the drain

2205
01:51:30,267 --> 01:51:33,144
Viva Las Vegas
turning day into nighttime

2206
01:51:33,228 --> 01:51:34,896
Turning night into daytime

2207
01:51:34,980 --> 01:51:39,150
lf you see it once
you'll never be the same again

2208
01:51:41,069 --> 01:51:44,071
l gotta keep on runnin'
Gonna have me some fun

2209
01:51:44,156 --> 01:51:47,283
lf it costs me
my very last dime

2210
01:51:47,367 --> 01:51:50,411
lf l wind up broke
then l'll always remember

2211
01:51:50,495 --> 01:51:53,247
That l had a swingin' time

2212
01:51:53,332 --> 01:51:56,959
Oh, l'm gonna give it
everything l've got

2213
01:51:57,044 --> 01:52:00,004
Lady Luck's with me,
Dice, stay hot

2214
01:52:00,088 --> 01:52:02,965
Got coke up my nose
to dry away the snot

2215
01:52:03,050 --> 01:52:06,427
So Viva Las Vegas

2216
01:52:06,511 --> 01:52:12,683
Viva Las Vegas

2217
01:52:12,768 --> 01:52:15,436
Viva, Viva

2218
01:52:15,520 --> 01:52:20,691
Las Vegas

2219
01:52:20,776 --> 01:52:22,693
Whee!

